{"parse": {"title": "5SP-02", "pageid": 8639, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/5SP-01\" title=\"5SP-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">5SP-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/5SP-03\" title=\"5SP-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">5SP</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.B9.BF.E9.80.8F.E7.9A.84.E7.A7.91.E5.AD.A6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"湿透的科学\">湿透的科学</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 湿透的科学</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Soaked Science</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>场<span class=\"color-value\"></span>糟<span class=\"color-value\"></span>糕<span class=\"color-value\"></span>至<span class=\"color-value\"></span>极<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>瓢<span class=\"color-value\"></span>泼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>大<span class=\"color-value\"></span>雨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>后<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>很<span class=\"color-value\"></span>难<span class=\"color-value\"></span>再<span class=\"color-value\"></span>保<span class=\"color-value\"></span>持<span class=\"color-value\"></span>冷<span class=\"color-value\"></span>静<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 31002</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan\"><img alt=\"guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png/600px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png/900px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png/1200px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>维尔汀成为“司辰”之前……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>咦～原来维尔汀不是一开始就是司辰的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>她没有告诉你吗？……不对，谁也不会一出生下来就是司辰吧，这又不是什么世袭爵位！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>总之，这是基金会内的核心成员才能知晓的机密年表。在你成为真正的调查员之前，你的查阅行为都需要在纪律辅员的监督下进行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛蒂尔达小心翼翼地掸去了档案袋上的灰尘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>无论如何，它不应该被粗暴地塞在这个满是灰尘的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>为了评估它的……真实性和风险性，天才玛蒂尔达·布翁尼要履行纪律辅员的职责，对它进行一次详细的检查！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>如果你认可这一处理决议，请点一点你的头，苏芙比助理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这段话充满了晦涩而陌生的名词。但好在淑女早就决定了自己的回答——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>好……好的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>如果1996年是一个懵懂无知的清晨，1985年就是一个惨无人道的黑夜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>没有人料到时间还会再度倒退。也没有人知道倒退意味着什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>时至今日，我仍能想起保利娜的悲鸣。她倒在了总部大门的入口，只有一只手进入了安全区——上面还戴着她订婚时的戒指。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>她最爱的蓝色波点丝巾掉在一旁，我们用它包裹了这仅有的遗体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>我敬佩那些依然保持冷静的同事，也理解那些濒临崩溃的神秘学家。这和我四分之一的神秘学家血统无关，只是人类在无可逆转的巨大悲剧前的本能共情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>我们失去了许多同僚。在他们留下的记录中，许多人记录了血管异变为电线的惊异光景。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>“暴雨”，一个过分直观的词，它在那之后开始使用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>我们能用它指代这场奇观。可是，我们能用什么指代所有的荒诞和惶然？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>时间，我们都知道它。它本该是连接过去和未来之间的一条直线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>因此我们直线前进。我们离开蒙昧，建立文明，发展科技，推动人类的福祉，改善居住的条件。我们确信自己行走在进步的坦途上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>——现在这条路却从脚下被抽走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>时间，我们最熟悉的老朋友。你要把我们带回哪里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>带回20世纪最大的两次浩劫？带回第一台蒸汽机未曾鸣响之时？带回启蒙的曙光未曾照亮之处？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>那样我们所有的努力……这些发电机、汽车、高架桥、铁路、医院、救济所……又有什么意义？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>我们就像时间孤岛上的难民，注视着整个现代世界在海潮中陨落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>基金会损失了许多同僚，可是科算中心的混乱比这还要严重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>我弟弟是我认识的人中最为理性的。在时代再度倒退的第一天，他冷静地告诉我：</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>“至少我们再次验证了牛顿是多么的正确。因为经典力学从来没有给出时间箭头——哈！相对论和量子力学里也没有！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>“所以这是完全正常的！无论时间是前进、倒放，还是旋转着踢一段桌上足球，都是合乎物理规律的。我们甚至还能穿越回去给庞加莱颁个预言奖！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>第二天，他因为过量饮酒，险些从六楼向下摔死。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>一切旧有的时空观念都被粉碎了，我们无从在已知的任何一种学科里找到“暴雨”的解释。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>要么，我们一直以来完全错了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>要么，世界在一夜之间再也不同了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>而这个新世界……不可能是科学的，也不可能是物理的。它不可独立验证，不可被理性理解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>难道我们真的一直错了……？难道那些被历史放逐之人……那些宣称自己拥有灵知的神秘学家们……才是正确的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>终结这场混乱的的确不是人类。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>它……我不知道它是什么。它宣称自己是一个永不停歇的机器，嘲笑我们受制于大脑的短路，陷入无穷无尽的形而上学错误。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>但它的确解决了最紧要的问题——在它上任后，一个针对“暴雨”的应急系统被建立起来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>第一步就是和当前年代的所有分部取得联系，清算可调配的人力，以及在全球建立观测站点，寻找其它的免疫“暴雨”区域。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>多个推算“暴雨”成因的工作室建立了。尽管人们在理论上争执不休，但总归是迈出了前进的一步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>我申请了这项任务，基于一种摆脱迷茫的决心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>1986年我受任前往埃及分部。所有熟识的人都来为我送行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>我们知道，此行可能是诀别。尽管科算中心配发了应急通讯装置，但我们仍无从知晓“暴雨”何时会来，附近又是否有避难点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>我并不畏惧牺牲。我害怕的是一无所知地死去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>而就在那艘从雅典去往亚历山大港的轮渡上……我遇到了“她”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>想在那艘轮渡上注意不到这个神秘学家团体是非常困难的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>他们大约有十来人，穿着古怪的拼接长袍，信奉一种神秘主义和数学混合的奇特教义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>和他们的交谈让我深感迷惑。但在当时，我的首要感受是振奋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>他们同样躲过了1996年的“暴雨”，注意到了世界的异变。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>——我遇到了另一帮来自千禧年的时间遗民。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan\"><img alt=\"guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png/600px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png/900px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png/1200px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>翻页的手指戛然停下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>……等一下，等一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>一个能躲过“暴雨”的神秘学家团体？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "5SP-02"}}